      "en": "**Self-edit** a day after writing: (1) cut 20% of the words, (2) paragraphs under 5 lines, (3) sentences under 25 words, (4) little passive voice, (5) every snippet tested, (6) every link working, (7) LanguageTool for mistakes. The day’s gap lets you see with the reader’s eyes."
